  {
   "id": "g9DFtDlCsrSbJbHA2SCi",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 28,
   "y": 1480.0,
   "width": 873.6,
   "height": 200.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1126567267,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1943261411,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1761100000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Happy path (numbers on the arrows)\n1. Student submits from the Mobile App (WAF → API Gateway: auth, rate limiting, throttling)\n2. Submission Service validates deadline and attempts; the file goes straight to S3\n3. Submission Service publishes SubmissionReceived to the Event Bus\n4. Scheduler Service classifies the job by course type and priority\n5. The job is enqueued in its course-type queue (bulkhead)\n6. A Spot worker pulls the job and starts the sandbox (base image already on disk)\n7. Grader runs tests + checklist (LLM for open-ended criteria) → JobCompleted\n8. Results Service stores the grade (idempotent) in PostgreSQL and Redis\n9-10. Notification Service sends the push notification to the app",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "R7BXdeOTeGjiIL1jRqYD",
   "originalText": "Happy path (numbers on the arrows)\n1. Student submits from the Mobile App (WAF → API Gateway: auth, rate limiting, throttling)\n2. Submission Service validates deadline and attempts; the file goes straight to S3\n3. Submission Service publishes SubmissionReceived to the Event Bus\n4. Scheduler Service classifies the job by course type and priority\n5. The job is enqueued in its course-type queue (bulkhead)\n6. A Spot worker pulls the job and starts the sandbox (base image already on disk)\n7. Grader runs tests + checklist (LLM for open-ended criteria) → JobCompleted\n8. Results Service stores the grade (idempotent) in PostgreSQL and Redis\n9-10. Notification Service sends the push notification to the app",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "rD7IDdshnLFHjiZvaBwq",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 980,
