  {
   "id": "n311DNxi2VYDXgJqx7As",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1948,
   "y": 1495.0,
   "width": 856.8,
   "height": 170.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 143968892,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 749665937,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1761100000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LLM usage\n• Rubric Compiler Service: the LLM turns the professor's rubric into tests,\n  checklists and grading prompts; the professor approves a preview\n• Grader calls the LLM OUTSIDE the sandbox (student code has no network)\n• LLM call path: LLM Gateway → Rate Limiter → Circuit Breaker → Retry → LLM Provider\n• Response Cache (by submission hash) + Output Validator (JSON Schema)\n• Prompt injection: submissions are treated as data, deterministic tests weigh\n  more, and outlier grades are flagged for professor review",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "WHFki7mv7aC75dm2KdDf",
   "originalText": "LLM usage\n• Rubric Compiler Service: the LLM turns the professor's rubric into tests,\n  checklists and grading prompts; the professor approves a preview\n• Grader calls the LLM OUTSIDE the sandbox (student code has no network)\n• LLM call path: LLM Gateway → Rate Limiter → Circuit Breaker → Retry → LLM Provider\n• Response Cache (by submission hash) + Output Validator (JSON Schema)\n• Prompt injection: submissions are treated as data, deterministic tests weigh\n  more, and outlier grades are flagged for professor review",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "VBYYh1fqPcE7rbXWkiBJ",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 2900,
