   "seed": 1193448721,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2002283307,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1761100000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What was scaled (vs. base architecture)\n• BFFs and services run N replicas behind the Load Balancer\n• One queue + one Spot pool per course type (bulkhead); q-prog-hot for large courses\n• Queue-based autoscaling (KEDA) + Karpenter + pre-warming before deadlines\n• Diversified Spot pools: many instance types and Availability Zones\n• Base images (3–5 GB) pre-baked on node disks: no image pull\n• PostgreSQL read replica + distributed Redis cache (cache-aside)\n• AI in 2 phases: CPU smoke test per attempt, GPU only for the final submission\nPeak (Sunday 23:59): Programming ~10 nodes · Architecture ~11 · AI smoke ~4\n· AI GPU 30–50 GPUs · ~550 vCPU total; pools scale to ~0 off-peak",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "VBYYh1fqPcE7rbXWkiBJ",
   "originalText": "What was scaled (vs. base architecture)\n• BFFs and services run N replicas behind the Load Balancer\n• One queue + one Spot pool per course type (bulkhead); q-prog-hot for large courses\n• Queue-based autoscaling (KEDA) + Karpenter + pre-warming before deadlines\n• Diversified Spot pools: many instance types and Availability Zones\n• Base images (3–5 GB) pre-baked on node disks: no image pull\n• PostgreSQL read replica + distributed Redis cache (cache-aside)\n• AI in 2 phases: CPU smoke test per attempt, GPU only for the final submission\nPeak (Sunday 23:59): Programming ~10 nodes · Architecture ~11 · AI smoke ~4\n· AI GPU 30–50 GPUs · ~550 vCPU total; pools scale to ~0 off-peak",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
